                                        "entry_id": "0cb5f5de-06ec-3adc-8d1c-fc9aedee5e6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A graduated glass tube, closed at one end, that is used for measuring the change in the volume of gases during a chemical reaction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99aee266-8ee4-461d-b00e-9fc1adf70ae2",
                                                "sense_id": "5f6b8745-9061-3aa1-9909-25eeffa1aacf",
                                                "text": "The same ingenious gentleman has also invented some Eudiometers, or instruments, to ascertain with the greatest accuracy, the salubrity of the air."
                                            }
